                                                "sense_id": "27bddc42-b1c4-3a96-9c28-80b2ac8383b2",
                                                "text": "The first microtome was constructed for John Hill, to make the specimens described in his book on the structure of timber (1770)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
